{"3913840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drink Factory Simulator", "steam_appid": 3913840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/0421d9a24d7e04386fe40c0b833c740b.avif?t=1786620956\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras_big/0421d9a24d7e04386fe40c0b833c740b.webp?t=1786620956 width=1560 height=695 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Add to your Wishlist to support us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/b94e382481a549afdba7dd2ad6b989e0.poster.avif?t=1786620956\" width=780 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/b94e382481a549afdba7dd2ad6b989e0.webm?t=1786620956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb57ea31c25b.poster.avif?t=1786620956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb57ea31c25b.webm?t=1786620956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb57ea31c25b.mp4?t=1786620956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Most simulation games hand you the recipes. This one doesn't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Drink Factory Simulator,</strong> you discover every drink yourself. Every recipe comes down to ingredients and ratios. You find the right mix by experimenting, analyzing, and keeping costs under control. This discovery isn't a side feature of the game. It's the core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small mixer, figure out the right recipes, scale your production line into a massive automated facility, and fulfill your customers' orders on time. Manage production during the day, test your recipes in analysis mode, and make deliveries in the open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/bdfa9d59011cec12a1966e492801c204.poster.avif?t=1786620956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/bdfa9d59011cec12a1966e492801c204.webm?t=1786620956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/bdfa9d59011cec12a1966e492801c204.mp4?t=1786620956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍹 Build your own beverage empire.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔬 <strong>Discover and Develop Recipes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soda, cola, energy drinks and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No recipes are handed to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right ratio, earn high scores and land big orders</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Analysis and Experiment Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your recipes and see which ingredients are right or wrong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the perfect drink through trial and error</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏭 <strong>Expand and Manage Your Factory</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new machines and upgrade your production line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from a small mixer to a massive automated facility</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 <strong>Order System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill your customers' demands on time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase satisfaction with quality production</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.poster.avif?t=1786620956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.webm?t=1786620956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.mp4?t=1786620956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏪 <strong>Store Management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own store, stock the shelves and sell at the register</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛻 <strong>Open World Deliveries</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make large deliveries to the port by truck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send individual orders to shops</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Economy and Management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your money, unlock new recipes and grow your factory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391384